  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anticipatory Flood Response in Eastern Nepal - Food security-Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this anticipatory action project is to provide agricultural assistance based on early flood warnings to people in the east of Nepal. This FAO project provides early warning messages and storage bags so agricultural households can protect their seeds. The project provides life-saving assistance to 25,000 people in the Food Security sector, including 5,000 women, 15,000 children, and 500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
